# Hoist all transitive deps so the compiled `client/dist/` can be consumed
# as @terriflux/sankeyapplication via a `file:` link from the examples
# (webpack resolves modules via realpath and remounts node_modules from
# inside client/dist/...; without hoisting, pnpm's virtual `.pnpm/` store
# is unreachable from there).
public-hoist-pattern[]=*
